  "prefLabel": "Pod 403.02 Change of Address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pod 403.02 Change of Address. All licensees and applicants for licensure shall notify the OPLC of any change in home or business address within 10 days of such change.\n\nSource. #9901-A, eff 4-15-11, EXPIRED: 4-15-19\n\nNew. #12811, INTERIM, eff 6-14-19, EXPIRED: 12-11-19\n\nNew. #13819, eff 2-9-24; ss by #14457, eff 2-8-26, EXPIRES: 2-8-36",
